'''The Grateful Crane''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that was added in [[Version 2.7 Update|Version 2.7]] and can be unlocked by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Ancient Heroes ULTRA SOULS (Gacha Event)|Ancient Heroes ULTRA SOULS]] and [[AIR BUSTERS (Gacha Event)|AIR BUSTERS]] events. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 7.1 Update|Version 7.1]] grants improved attack power and the ability to [[Freeze|freeze]] [[:Category:Angel Enemies|Angel]] and [[:Category:Floating Enemies|Floating]] enemies. [[Talents]] were added in [[Version 12.3 Update|Version 12.3]]. [[Ultra Form]] added in [[Version 14.2 Update|Version 14.2]] increases health, decreases cost, and grants [[Sage Slayer]], a guaranteed level 10 [[Wave Attack]], and [[Omni Strike]].

