==Trivia==
*Prior to [[Version 4.7 Update|Version 4.7]], The Grateful Crane was a part of two other [[Cat Combo]]s: [[Ancient Heroes (Removed Combo)|Ancient Heroes]] and [[Ultra Souls (Removed Combo)|Ultra Souls]].
*If one looks closely during Super Galaxy Cosmo's attack animation, the projectile he fires is actually a giant glowing crane.
*He has the second longest attack animation of any Cat Unit in the game, only beaten by [[Filibuster Cat X (Special Cat)|Filibuster Cat]].
*This unit is loosely based on [[wikipedia:Tsuru no Ongaeshi|Crane's Return of a Favor]].
*Supernova Cosmo is tied with [[Chicken Cat (Uber Rare Cat)|Rooster Cat]] and [[Crazed Titan Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Manic Jamiera Cat]] for the longest Wave attack of any Cat unit, at 10.
**He is the only Cat unit with a guaranteed Wave attack at that level.
*The evolved form references the anime series [[wikipedia:Saint Seiya|Saint Seiya]]. The armor greatly resembles the combination between Cygnus & Pegasus Cloth. The crane circlet and shield-like armlet are highly resembling Cygnus Cloth's trademark while the breastplate, shoulder, hip and leg armor resembling more like the Pegasus Cloth.
**"Cosmo" is another reference to the energy in the Saint Seiya franchise.

